{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hypotenuse\" title=\"Hypotenuse\">hypotenuse</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> has side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb1b7b0526168d6f1aa059eaabc8b9ec9a3421ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />. <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Altitude\" title=\"Altitude\">Altitude</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/e/20e8e26d580012b86d8fe55e70e5740908c35af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CH$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> into segments <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3ddf9a5fa2fca5c4787d4f989af0eef1387bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH$\" width=\"30\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/eadb64f51f3d2f727a5e340539621cac9a23087e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HB$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16ccd1b5301d3980b3fe15b9d9a84c2af63b196.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HB=16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />. The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Area\" title=\"Area\">area</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/6/ae66cd1a142516b980bf3e6413bae5052def6dab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }120 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }144 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 150 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }216 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 144\\sqrt{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"460\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd2d6da5d64a48e003fd0fd9198da3736be361e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(.4cm); draw((0,0)--(0,12)); draw((9,0)--(-16,0)); draw((9,0)--(0,12)); draw((-16,0)--(0,12)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,(9,0),ENE); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,(-16,0),WNW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,(0,12),ENE); label(&quot;$H$&quot;,(0,0),S); label(&quot;$15$&quot;,(4.5,6),NE); label(&quot;$16$&quot;,(-8,0),S); [/asy]\" width=\"522\" height=\"265\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/8/0887caa95260cdb61e43fc9227992aa0af0e2788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AHC\\sim ACB$\" width=\"110\" height=\"13\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0b3dbb5e0c16cabfa02f10ace626714ac385dbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AA$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5bc7264ea7a0e47c7fca13ff783fd464eee4e64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AH}{AC}=\\frac{AC}{AH+16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"131\" height=\"39\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/1/fb1b7b0526168d6f1aa059eaabc8b9ec9a3421ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/3/f3316243dd48c1e4dff9d51f741e6273ccba5e00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AH}{15}=\\frac{15}{AH+16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"131\" height=\"39\" />. Cross mutliplying, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/b/87be3b7e9360ec9f291f1482bcdb5acd9a645766.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH(AH+16)=225$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"165\" height=\"18\" />. Solving this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quadratic\">quadratic</a> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b70d7b575fda096d081fb97d4138e4daffc312c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AH=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/9/329d82c3fd852cb8f04911c4aae884da4b5c07a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AHC\\sim CHB$\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/9/0a97de095698f1d5de3c366b0d0b8cecb318ed4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{AH} {HC}=\\frac{HC}{HB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />. Substituting in known values, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a303f677f388545b6e445a9733b675d92bb3792.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{HC}=\\frac{HC}{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/0/9103a8fa1d7901277f070fac7c39e2cd5e21e8cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HC^2=144$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"89\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614e4a3a4c923ee0ef25d9149f8b1f721f3b6997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$HC=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>The area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/8/1987623f762b2d725c7e07b62f5bd8d13858238e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}(AB)(HC)=\\frac{1}{2}(25)(12)=150, \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"286\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">1